{"_v":1,"id":"gypsy-2008","bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":2,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2008/03/28/theater/reviews/28gyps.html","d":"2008-03-28","q":"This “Gypsy” spends much of its time in such intoxicating air."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"Variety","s":92,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2008/legit/reviews/gypsy-7-1200535549/","d":"2008-03-27","q":"This is not your everyday canned tuner; in this production it’s an incisively acted musical play with as much emotional resonance as showbiz pizzazz."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/gypsy-review-audra-mcdonalds-turn-on-broadway-ff528df3","q":"Ms. McDonald's lifts this staging to majestic (sorry) heights."},{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":84,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.vulture.com/2008/03/theater_gypsy.html","d":"2008-03-28","q":"Patti LuPone's Mama Rose is a force of nature, delivering a performance that's both volcanic and precisely controlled."},{"cn":"Chris Jones","o":"Chicago Tribune","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/236325348/","d":"2008-03-30","q":"But I say she carries the burden gloriously."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/730768700/","d":"2008-03-28","q":"At Tuesday's press preview, at least, her performance felt rushed, tightly wound and overdone."},{"cn":"David Finkle","o":"TheaterMania","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.theatermania.com/news/gypsy_13303/#:~:text=Reviews,about%20a%20monstrous%20stage%20mother.","d":"2008-03-27","q":"In a performance that’ll have musical comedy fanatics buzzing for months, LuPone executes a show-biz finish to end all finishes."},{"cn":"Clive Barnes","o":"New York Post","s":84,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://nypost.com/2008/03/28/gypsy-gets-a-brilliant-revival/","d":"2008-03-28","q":"Patti